{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c559","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a8b2-a089-7723-8537-dec58af692fc"},"sequence":263,"recorded_at":1780531400000521,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"1f98f4d5-2046-45d7-b0a2-84eb8d173d9f","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"1f98f4d5-2046-45d7-b0a2-84eb8d173d9f","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"1f98f4d5-2046-45d7-b0a2-84eb8d173d9f"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a8b3-51c7-7c93-9c24-3082e996f042"},"task_id":"01a0a8b3-51c7-7c93-9c24-3082e996f042","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a8b3-51c7-7c93-9c24-3082e996f042","chunk":"Read text file `/tmp/rev34/outcome_v3.md`.\n1|# TASK-260916-13diw4: register-mac-and-repository-access — developer outcome v3\n2|\n3|Status: ready for review (board `to-review`, uncommitted candidate in story worktree).\n4|\n5|This run fixes ALL FIVE revision-2 review findings (R2-F1…R2-F5,\n6|`changes_requested`, `repeat-of: revision 1 / F5` for R2-F2) with the\n7|reviewer's production-entry attacks adopted as committed named regressions,\n8|plus narrowing mutants for every new gate. Prior M1–M12 evidence was\n9|re-executed against the reworked code (M9 still survives with the same\n10|stated bound).\n11|\n12|## Fixes (code)\n13|\n14|1. **R2-F1 — list URLs used encoded `%3F` paths.** `GitHubRunnerAPIClient`\n15|   now builds list URLs via `URLComponents` with real `per_page=100` query\n16|   items (`listURL`); the `?`-in-`appendingPathComponent` shape is gone from\n17|   all three list methods (runners, groups, group repositories).\n18|2. **R2-F2 — remote name match authorized foreign writes (repeat-of rev1/F5).**\n19|   New `LocalRegistration` read (`RunnerInstallerService.readLocalRegistration`)\n20|   plus gates `verifiedLocalAgentID` (configured marker + agent ID + name +\n21|   scope match) and `boundRemoteRunnerID` (bind by verified agent ID; same-name\n22|   foreign or renamed entries throw; absent-without-name returns nil for\n23|   convergence). `registerRunner` verifies after config and on resume;\n24|   `applyLabels` verifies before any network and re-binds on every write —\n25|   the stored ID is never trusted across edits/retries/drift. The old\n26|   name-match `resolveRemoteRunnerID` is deleted.\n27|3. **R2-F3 — scope/path edits reused old evidence.** `Flow.updateDraft` and\n28|   the reducer invalidate progress on scope/install-dir/name/group/workFolder\n29|   changes (selective matrices, mirrored): install/runner/group/asset state\n30|   and `completedSteps` drop, `.done` demotes to `.drafting`, stale\n31|   `failedStep`s clear, editable selections re-target pending retries to the\n32|   visible values. Retry-after-scope-change is a safe no-op.\n33|4. **R2-F4 — first-page reads reported as complete.** All three list methods\n34|   follow `Link: rel=\"next\"` to completion (`getAllPages`, same-host HTTPS\n35|   only, 100-page fail-closed cap); any failed page throws.\n36|   `applyRepositoryAccess` compares the complete confirm against the request\n37|   (`confirmRepositoryIDs`, both directions) and keeps the requested\n38|   selection on mismatch instead of claiming partial success.\n39|5. **R2-F5 — service setup claimed done before registration.**\n40|   `setupService` requires the verified configured local identity; the Page\n41|   disables Setup Service until `registerRunner` completes and names the\n42|   prerequisite.\n43|\n44|## AC coverage — 8 of 8 rows driven through production entry points\n45|\n46|| # | AC row | Named committed test(s) | Production call site |\n47||---|--------|-------------------------|----------------------|\n48|| 1 | Org registration without terminal | `orgWizardEndToEndDeletesTokenAndLeaksNothing` (now ID-bound 4242/4242) | `Flow.apply` (.beginDraft/.resolveGroup/.downloadAndInstall/.registerRunner/.setupService) |\n49|| 2 | Repo registration without terminal | `repoWizardOmitsRunnerGroup`, `repoRunnerListRequestUsesQueryNotEncodedPath` | same Flow effects; no `runner-groups` traffic, no `--runnergroup` argv |\n50|| 3 | Selected repos are applied | `orgResolveGroupCreatesWithSelectedRepos`, `repoAccessAppliesAndConfirmsRealIDs`, `repositoryConfirmationFollowsPagination` | `createGroup` / `setGroupRepositories` + paginated `fetchGroupRepositories` confirm |\n51|| 4 | Repo access and labels changeable | `repoAccessAppliesAndConfirmsRealIDs`, `labelsApplyRequiresRealRunnerIDThenPuts` (rewritten: not-found then bound PUT 4242) | `Flow.apply(.applyRepositoryAccess/.applyLabels)` with verified IDs |\n52|| 5 | Failed ops avoid orphans | `failedConfigDeletesTokenAndReportsScrubbedError`, `registerIsIdempotentAcrossRetries`, `registerRefusesMismatchedRemoteIdentity` | `Flow.registerRunner` (token deleted on every failure path; single mint/config) |\n53|| 6 | Repeated ops avoid duplicates | `registerIsIdempotentAcrossRetries`, `retryResumesFailedDownloadWithoutDuplicates`, `remoteDuplicateWithoutReplaceIsRefusedBeforeToken`, `runnerListFollowsPaginationForDuplicateGuard`, `existingRegistrationBlocksFreshInstall` | complete-list `rejectRemoteDuplicate` gate + installer markers |\n54|| 7 | No secret leakage | `orgWizardEndToEndDeletesTokenAndLeaksNothing`, `runConfigScrubsTokenFromFailure`, `failedConfigDeletesTokenAndReportsScrubbedError` | token only in config.sh argv in memory; absent from actions/URLs/headers/bodies; deleted after use |\n55|| 8 | Tests exercise actual entry points | all Flow tests + `setupServiceWritesManualPlistFoundByDiscovery`, `runConfigExecutesRealScript`, `scopeChangeClearsCompletedStepsInState` | `Flow.apply`, `RunnerInstallerService.*`, `State.reduce`, cross-checked by `RunnerDiscovery.installed` and a real shell `config.sh` |\n56|\n57|Negative/refusal coverage (each fails when the gate admits what it must\n58|reject): all v2 negatives retained, plus `labelsWithoutLocalRegistrationAreRefused`\n59|(zero network), `labelsWithMismatchedRemoteIdentityAreRefused`,\n60|`registerRefusesMismatchedRemoteIdentity`, `labelsRefusePlantedUnconfiguredRegistration`,\n61|`changedScopeMustNotReuseRegistrationOrRemoteID`,\n62|`installDirChangeKeepsGroupButRequiresFreshInstall`,\n63|`groupNameChangeInvalidatesResolvedGroup`, `retryAfterScopeChangeIsNoop`,\n64|`repositoryConfirmationMismatchIsRefused` (both directions),\n65|`repositorySecondPageFailurePreservesUnknown`,\n66|`serviceCannotClaimDoneBeforeRegistration`,\n67|`serviceRefusesMismatchedLocalRegistration`, and the pure-gate pins\n68|`verifiedLocalAgentIDRefusesEachMismatchClass` /\n69|`boundRemoteRunnerIDBindsByID` / `scopeChangeRefreshesDownloadAsset` /\n70|`registerReportsNilWhenAgentNotYetListed`.\n71|\n72|## Narrowing-mutant evidence (this run, each reverted pristine via `cmp`)\n73|\n74|New gates:\n75|\n76|| Mutant | Admits exactly | Named failing test(s) | Result |\n77||--------|----------------|-----------------------|--------|\n78|| M13: runners path carries `?per_page=100` | encoded runners URL only | `orgListRequestsUseQueryNotEncodedPath` | KILLED, 2 issues; groups control passes |\n79|| M14: name check admits `\"someone-else\"` | one wrong-name member | `serviceRefusesMismatchedLocalRegistration`, `verifiedLocalAgentIDRefusesEachMismatchClass` | KILLED, 3 + 1 issues (mutant wrote the plist) |\n80|| M15: same-name returns `foreign.id` | one foreign-ID member (R2-F2 class) | `labelsWithMismatchedRemoteIdentityAreRefused`, `registerRefusesMismatchedRemoteIdentity` | KILLED, 7 issues (mutant PUT to `/runners/77/labels`); nil-absence control passes |\n81|| M16: scope branch skipped | scope-change reuse only | `scopeChangeRefreshesDownloadAsset` | KILLED, 2 issues (stale asset reused); dir-branch control passes |\n82|| M17: `nextPageURL` skips `/repositories` | repo-second-page skip only | `repositoryConfirmationFollowsPagination` | KILLED, 2 issues; runners/groups pagination controls pass |\n83|| M18: setupService skips verification | unverified-service member only | `serviceCannotClaimDoneBeforeRegistration` | KILLED, 3 issues (mutant emitted serviceReady + plist); labels gate intact |\n84|| M19: confirm admits subsets | subset member only | `repositoryConfirmationMismatchIsRefused` | KILLED, 3 issues on missing-direction only; extras-direction passes |\n85|| M20: unconfigured admitted when name present | one planted member | `labelsRefusePlantedUnconfiguredRegistration`, `verifiedLocalAgentIDRefusesEachMismatchClass` | KILLED, 3 + 1 issues (mutant PUT); other 4 pin cases pass |\n86|\n87|Re-executed prior mutants (adjacent/touched regions included):\n88|M1, M2, M3, M4, M5, M6, M7, M8, M9b, M10, M11, M12 — all KILLED by their\n89|v2-named tests. M9 (`createGroup` default true→false) still SURVIVES\n90|(exit 0) with the same bound: the default is not load-bearing, Flow passes\n91|`true` explicitly, M9b kills the call site. Bound stated, not hidden.\n92|\n93|The source-text-token mutant rule does not apply: no gate inspects source\n94|text.\n95|\n96|## Verification commands (real exit codes)\n97|\n98|- `swift test --package-path Packages/RunnerControlCore` (CI gate):\n99|  **exit 0, 132 tests passed** (110 + 22 new R2 regressions/pins).\n100|- `python3 -m unittest discover -s Scripts/tests` (CI gate): **exit 0,\n101|  4 tests OK**.\n102|- `xcodebuild -workspace RunnerControl.xcworkspace -scheme RunnerControl\n103|  -destination 'platform=macOS' build`: **BUILD SUCCEEDED** (exit 0);\n104|  warnings are the pre-existing Swift 6 Sendable class on untouched lines\n105|  (Page 157/216/242/248/288 etc.); the `stepRow(enabled:)` change adds none.\n106|- No repo-configured lint gate (CI runs only the two test jobs above).\n107|- Generator inputs untouched: `ios-app-manager.json`, `Project.swift`,\n108|  `Workspace.swift`, `Package.swift` files unmodified (no new source files\n109|  added, so no `tuist generate` needed); existing production runners\n110|  untouched (all test IO under temp roots; services never bootstrapped).\n111|\n112|## Files changed (all UNCOMMITTED in story worktree, as required)\n113|\n114|- `Packages/RunnerControlCore/Sources/GitHubRunnerAPIClient.swift` —\n115|  `listURL`/`perform`/`getAllPages`/`nextPageURL`; paginated runners/groups/\n116|  group-repositories.\n117|- `…/RunnerRegistration+Models.swift` — `LocalRegistration`,\n118|  `unverifiedRegistration`/`remoteIdentityMismatch`/`remoteRunnerNotFound`/\n119|  `confirmationMismatch` errors.\n120|- `…/RunnerRegistration+Gates.swift` — `verifiedLocalAgentID`,\n121|  `scopeMatches`, `boundRemoteRunnerID`, `confirmRepositoryIDs`.\n122|- `…/RunnerInstallerService.swift` — `readLocalRegistration`\n123|  (`readAgentID` delegates, behavior-identical).\n124|- `…/RunnerRegistration+Flow.swift` — verified identity for\n125|  register/labels/service, confirm-compare, `invalidateProgress` matrix.\n126|- `…/RunnerRegistration+State+Reducer.swift` — mirrored invalidation +\n127|  `.done` demotion on identity edits.\n128|- `Targets/RunnerControl/Sources/RunnerRegistrationPage.swift` — Setup\n129|  Service gated on `registerRunner` completion with prerequisite copy.\n130|- `Packages/RunnerControlCore/Tests/RunnerRegistrationTests.swift` — 5\n131|  fixtures re-bound to verified IDs (77/78/99→4242), labels test rewritten,\n132|  22 new R2 regression/pin tests, scope-aware `SplitExecutor`.\n133|\n134|## Stated bounds (unknowns, not guesses)\n135|\n136|- Live checksum availability on the authenticated downloads endpoint is\n137|  still unverified (separate smoke task); the client decodes optional\n138|  `sha256_checksum` per the official OpenAPI schema and fails closed when\n139|  absent.\n140|- Pagination cap is 100 pages per list (fail-closed throw, never a silent\n141|  partial list).\n142|- Retry runs the *current* draft, not a snapshot — now safe because caches\n143|  invalidate on identity edits and every write re-binds to verified local\n144|  identity.\n145|- Ownership table stays per-Mac (`~/Library/GitHubActions/\n146|  .runnercontrol-groups.json`); two local users do not share it.\n147|- No live-GitHub verification in this run; transport covered by fakes, the\n148|  filesystem by temp-root fixtures with real `tar`/`shasum`/`config.sh`.","final_result":true}}}
